cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BULLKpy in your research, please cite both the software and the preprint below."
title: "BULLKpy: An AnnData-Inspired Unified Framework for Comprehensive Bulk OMICs Analysis"
abstract: >-
  BULLKpy is a Python framework for comprehensive bulk OMICs analysis, built on
  AnnData and inspired by the Scanpy/scverse ecosystem. It provides quality
  control, normalisation, dimensionality reduction, clustering, differential
  expression, gene set enrichment, metaprogram and survival analyses, together
  with publication-ready visualisation, in a single consistent workflow.
